# Code owners of tn-p2p-allow-sync.
#
# grantkee is the only maintainer today, so every rule names that one login.
# A maintainer who later holds a release key joins each rule.
# The rules bind once the branch protection of main requires a review from code owners (.github/ACTIONS.md, "Settings the release workflow requires").

# release signing: the pointer to tn-release-signing, where it is fetched from, and the values and hooks release.sh enforces
/release       @grantkee
/.gitmodules   @grantkee
/release.conf  @grantkee
# the release build: the image recipe both builds use, the tag workflow, and the Makefile targets that wrap each step
/etc/Dockerfile                   @grantkee
/.github/workflows/release.yaml   @grantkee
/Makefile                         @grantkee
